The plate is a square-ish dish about 24 cm across. The rice pile is roughly 8-9 cm wide and about 6 cm tall in the image, so it covers a small area, and it is a low mound only 2-3 cm high. That works out to about 80-100 g of cooked rice.

Cooked rice has about 1.3 kcal/g, so 90 g is roughly 117 kcal. There are a few scattered grains and faint oil or sauce stains, which add a little, so I'll round up to about 125 kcal.

